	(descr "Raspberry Pi Pico / Pico W / Pico 2 W socket, header for Pico pins 1-20 (1x20 female, 2.54 mm, 8.5 mm insulator). This is HALF of the socket - pair it with noknok_Pico_Socket_P21-40_THT placed 17.78 mm away, perpendicular to the pad row, same rotation. The origin is this row centroid, so the position file reports a correct centroid for assembly. Carries the mechanical content for the pair: the Pico W antenna copper keep-out (all layers), the USB-cable courtyard and the board outline. Generated by tools/make_pico_socket_split.ps1 - do not hand-edit.")
